  "prefLabel": "Ed 409.08 Appeal of Decision of State Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 409.08 Appeal of Decision of State Board. Any party aggrieved by a decision of the state board may appeal the decision to a court of competent jurisdiction within 30 days of the decision. Pending appeal, the nonpublic school shall continue to operate.\n\nSource. #8263, eff 1-22-05; ss by #10360, eff 6-15-13; ss by #13853, eff 1-11-24 (formerly Ed 408.08) (See Revision Note a chapter heading for Ed 400)",
